ertex","+  separation and the layer bound, `n − α_greedy`, `|E| / 5.769`; per cell","+  and construction the fit `width / n = β⁺ + a / n` with `β*` and item 02's","+  `b` beside it, and the kill flag. 2,043 rows (2,024 accepted) in","+  `learning/data/excess_constructions.csv` (git-ignored), 1.61 core-hours","+  (98% the rule, `O(n²)`: 11–22 s at `n = 5000`), 751 s wall on 8 workers at","+  nice 19, load 1–9. **No exact solve**; `solutions/` and the ledger","+  untouched. `tests/test_excess_constructions.py`, 10 tests (the sweeps","+  against `mosp.verify.max_open_stacks` and brute-force vertex separation","+  on 200 random instances each, the rule's value against `two_key_rule`,","+  BFS layers and the greedy set checked structurally, proved constructions","+  above the certified optimum − 1 on 20 solved instances, seeds, the fit,","+  the tables). Figure `reports/figures/excess_beta_plus.png` (dataviz","+  reference palette, validated). `reports/excess_phase_diagram.md` §5 with","+  every table; scratch log and tables under","+  `reports/scratch/excess_constructions/`.","+- **Numbers.** The rule's `width / n` **falls** with `n` in all 36 cells","+  (item 02 expected an upward drift), the `1 / n` form fits with residuals","+  within ±0.009, and `β⁺` moves by ≤ 0.01 under `1 / √n` or `log n / n`.","+  `rule β⁺ − b` is 0.007–0.060: smallest at the ends of the excess (0.007 at","+  `(10, 2)`, 0.017 at `(2, 1)`), 0.035–0.047 at `d = 3–4` (ridge and","+  shoulder), 0.04–0.06 at every `μ = ½` cell; `rule β⁺` is below the","+  certified `opt / n` at `n = 75–125` on 20 of 23 cells. The proved","+  constructions: `n − α_greedy` 0.48–0.96 (flat in `n`), the edge bound","+  better only at `e ≲ 2–2.5` and above 1 from `(4, 1)`; best proved minus","+  `β*` 0.075 (`(10, 2)`) to 0.61, below 0.5 on 29 of 35 cells, so item 07's","+  kill is not met in advance but no proved construction is within 0.07 of","+  `β*` anywhere. BFS separation 0.13–0.96, 1.1–2.4× the rule — except on","+